      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِفْوَةٌ</span></b>  i. <i>q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِفْيَةٌ</span>, (K, TA, [in the CK, erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَفِيَّة</span>,]) an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَفِيتُ لَهُ</span> as syn.
